## Original Content
La cantante comenzó cierto deterioro tras la muerte de su marido, Carl Dean, en 2025. Llevaban 60 años juntos.

## Summary
Dolly Parton, known as the queen of country music, has died at the age of 80. Her health began to decline after the death of her husband, Carl Dean, in 2025, with whom she had been married for 60 years.

## Key Points
- Dolly Parton died at the age of 80.
- She was widely recognized as the queen of country music.
- Her health decline started following her husband Carl Dean's death in 2025.
- She was married to Carl Dean for 60 years.


